# Populate this manifest with the SHA-256 of each Oracle installer zip
# before running `vagrant up`. The guest-side provisioner verifies the SHA-256
# against these entries before extracting the zip into GI_HOME / DB_HOME.
#
# Example:
#   sha256sum ORCL_software/LINUX.X64_193000_grid_home.zip
#   sha256sum ORCL_software/LINUX.X64_193000_db_home.zip
#   sha256sum ORCL_software/p<bug>_190000_LINUX.zip
#
# Then copy the output here, replacing the example path with /vagrant/...
# Expected filenames:
#   /vagrant/LINUX.X64_193000_grid_home.zip
#   /vagrant/LINUX.X64_193000_db_home.zip
#   /vagrant/p<bug>_190000_LINUX.zip
#
# Format (one entry per line):
#   <sha256>  /vagrant/<installer-zip>
ba8329c757133da313ed3b6d7f86c5ac42cd9970a28bf2e6233f3235233aa8d8  /vagrant/LINUX.X64_193000_db_home.zip
d668002664d9399cf61eb03c0d1e3687121fc890b1ddd50b35dcbe13c5307d2e  /vagrant/LINUX.X64_193000_grid_home.zip
31e03f01b8ff6833e5c6601c3ceafc4277d9c43239ea933db736d5e2f4ec2516  /vagrant/p6880880_190000_Linux-x86-64.zip
9efb5614baf159f61282c6e886367c6d50634ac0930f35df6d4bf30dee348e3a  /vagrant/p39036936_190000_Linux-x86-64.zip
